  "writing_rules": [
    "This shard contains only source-backed events that occurred before the verified campaign anchor.",
    "Do not add an event while the continuity manifest anchor is unbound.",
    "Every event requires at least one approved primary-manga work, volume, and chapter locator; supplemental locators may only add nonconflicting support.",
    "Paraphrase facts without copied source prose, inferred future outcomes, or model-memory-only assertions.",
    "Keep each event paraphrase atomic enough that every material clause is supported by its attached locators.",
    "The shard lane controls retrieval only. It does not grant any character knowledge.",
    "A public or restricted event must not expose a predecessor ID from a more restricted lane.",
